# Data source — not currently read by any code in this app.
# src/lib/city.config.ts's per-city `dataBase` documents the future real URL
# shape; src/lib/data.ts reads local fixtures (now populated with real,
# owner-approved Praha data — see DIVERGENCE.md) instead.
DATA_REPO_BASE_URL=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/michalskop/cz-municipalities-votes-2022-2026/main
